    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Private collection, Paris [per Paul Rosenberg & Company, to the Art Institute of Chicago, Nov. 21, 1973, curatorial object file]. Sarec, S.A., Switzerland, by December 1972 [per Elaine Rosenberg, meeting notes, May 2002, curatorial object file and Sylvie Brame, Brame & Lorenceau, to the Art Institute of Chicago, June 19, 2002, curatorial object file]; sold to Paul Rosenberg & Company, New York, Dec. 1972 [per Elaine Rosenberg, meeting notes, May 2002, curatorial object file and Paul Rosenberg & Company, to the Art Institute of Chicago, Nov. 21, 1973, curatorial object file]; sold to the Art Institute of Chicago, 1973.",
      "classified_as": [
